# trio7b (w86, 2026-10-21): trio7's plan with one variable per pulse (start tick; most clears 2 later) and three
# changes, all redsim 32x2: (1) Q's pull of C fed IN-PLANE: a source on the B4 cell (-2,2) at o42 for 4 gt (fires
# SE(-2,1) directly, SE(-2,0) and Q by QC through L2; Q fires on arriving in L1 during SU(-1,-2)'s column push and its
# extending base blocks SE(-2,1)'s push); the off-plane (-1,1,1) input is gone; (2) SD(-1,3)'s o54 pulse held 4 gt
# pushes ML+Q down and pulls ML back (its o60 pulse merged away); (3) SW(4,1)'s pull/push at o4 / c4 (any tick works),
# so the bottom right can start from an observer at (4,0) right after the flip.
